{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Repline》是一款專注於舉重與力量訓練紀錄的 App，適合希望少花時間操作手機、多花時間在槓鈴上的訓練者。iPhone 與 Apple Watch 可全程同步，在手腕開始一組後手機即時顯示，反之亦然。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-50.webp\">\n<h2>專為舉重訓練而設的紀錄</h2>\n<p>先建立課表與範本，每次訓練直接套用；重量、次數與完成狀態一按即可記下，每組之間可設定休息計時。熱身組不計入正式組統計，另支援超級組與動作備註。Apple Watch 可獨立記錄整場訓練，並與 iPhone 全程即時同步。程式自動追蹤個人最佳成績，設動作庫與訓練歷史；資料只留在裝置，毋須帳戶或雲端。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-297-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-298-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-299-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-300-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-301-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Repline: Workout Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:39.757863+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":351,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:20:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T00:38:54.849916+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:39:00.735250+00:00","content_hash":"8366f6d249b9673b353d756e374fddd515678ce3ef94d467bdd7d5bd19a274ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}